{
  "about": "COMMON test data for the pipeline (jobs 4-5): loaded after the fresh install (4.2b), into the last release before the upgrade (5.3, the last release's own copy of this file from git) and again after the upgrade (5.7, insert + update: the delta). Never kept in the database between runs. A release that adds a table or a required column adds its rows here in the same PR (job 1 checks that every table has rows or a reason). Keys 900001+ and codes TD_ keep the rows apart from the seed data; TD_CASES is an example table name of the test application TDAPP (registries skip tables that do not exist).",
  "no_data": {
    "XXFND_SCHEMA_RELEASES": "the release record: written by the install / upgrade itself (XXFND_DDL_PKG.MARK_RELEASE) - test rows would hide a missing release step",
